{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18381","headline":"御沟新柳 · 刘遵古","name":"御沟新柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韶光先禁柳，几处覆沟新。\n映水疑分翠，含烟欲占春。\n悠悠迟日晚，褭褭好风频。\n吐节茸犹嫩，通条泽稍均。\n远和瑶草色，暗拂玉楼尘。\n愿假骞飞便，归栖及此辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘遵古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}